    <string name="ts_footer_body">A keybox is fetched and kept valid automatically. The revocation status is checked every 24 hours, and a new keybox is fetched from the official source if the current one is revoked or suspended.\n\nFor manual setup:\n1. Tap \"Fetch latest keybox\" to download one automatically, or import your own from a trusted source.\n2. Open \"Manage target apps\" and select the apps that require integrity checks.\n3. Set target mode to \"Leaf\" if your device has a working TEE; otherwise leave it as Auto.\n4. Recheck your Play Integrity status.\n\nNote: If no valid latest keybox is available, auto-fetch is paused for 24 hours before retrying. Always delete the existing keybox before importing a new one.</string>
